80,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-26T00:07:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:39:10Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T09:33:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproductible in: All 4.3, All 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.4.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a CharacterBody2D has an Area2D child node that detects collisions, when colliding a dedicated tilemap cell (that ones the Area2D is looking) the collision is well detected but, if the mouse overs another corresponding tilemap cell or the same one, the collision is detected again even if the character is not moving.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1- Open MRP\n2- Launch the MRP\n3- A collision must be detected, the log \"Collision detected. Body interaction has entered\" must be displayed. It's ok because the character is over a tilemap cell that have a collision shape which Area2D node's character is looking for.\n4- Move the player to the right until it overs the cell in the right (it's the cell representing the bottom right Godot icon eye)\n5- A collision must be detected too.\n6- Keep the player over one of this two cells\n7- Move the mouse over one of these two cells. The cell in the center top must become white and a collision (which is not expected) is detected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[collisionbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19458500/collisionbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Baptiste81","id":32779653,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc5NjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32779653?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81","html_url":"https://github.com/Baptiste81","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baptiste81/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}